Snarf a selection larger than SNARFSIZE (32000) and export it: the host
truncates the snarf buffer to SNARFSIZE when sending it to the terminal.
args: -R input

-- script --
startfile 0
snarf 0 0 32001
startsnarf
exit
-- input --

-- host --
Hversion 2
Hnewname tag=0
Hmovname tag=0 "input"
Hnewname tag=1
Hbindname tag=1
Hcurrent tag=1
Hmovname tag=1 "~~sam~~"
Hcheck0 tag=1
Hack
Hunlock
Hbindname tag=0
Hcurrent tag=0
